{
    "title": "Big Rig Racing: Drag racing",
    "description": "Big Rig Racing is a drag racing game on mega-cool trucks! \r\n\r\nBecome a formidable rival on 18-wheeler in drag racing games! Drive big trucks offroad & join the professionals. Team up to demolish the strongest gangs of racers on hot asphalt tracks and even chill icy roads! Build your career to be claimed as a winner in truck race! Get ready to experience the thrill of truck racing games like never before with us! With realistic physics and intuitive controls, you'll feel like you're behind the wheel of a real big rig in driving simulator. \r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZE AND UPGRADE CAR\r\nBRR offers advanced truck customizer options as you level up! Paintwork, rims, wheels, headlights, mirrors, bumpers & even tubes! Earn upgrades and other rewards! Get the best parts to create a road rip mac in diesel truck games.\r\n\r\nCOLLECT AND EXHIBIT TRUCKS\r\nExplore an amazingly enormous selection. Ageless classics and their forms are all available. Buy any modifications, add them & personalize how your machines look and run! Test out the possible combinations you can try in the garage! Exhibit your burnout monster, get votes & win!\r\n\r\nREALISTIC RIVALS\r\nDive in a story with off road outlaws you will be driving as you rise the ranks! Original and unique characters are waiting for you! Take down the top kings and prove to the entire world you're the best of the best! Truck em all!\r\n\r\nRACE MODES\r\nCompete in races against strong racers in different game modes: career (story), race (series), tournament (ladder) or high stakes (daily race). Trailers races and even a tournament ladder to win yourself some nice cash! In addition to a brand new High Stakes mode that lets you put your money where your mouth is! Classic Drag Racing simulator: train and practice on tracks to perfect your skills and time! Many locations and options to choose from! \r\n\r\nSEASON SYSTEM\r\nNew location, themed semi trucks, & Season System! Get the most out of limited seasons with popular themes. Check out the arena, roulette, season awards, and get a season pass in no limits drag games.\r\n\r\nTEAMS\r\nUnite with other players and reach the most elite Race League. Compete with strong race rivals and get awesome rewards. Use Boosters to keep team rank position and move higher to tops.\r\n\r\nTHE ULTIMATE DRAG RACE GAMES EXPERIENCE\r\n- Stellar graphics\r\n- A phenomenal collection of 18 wheeler trucks\r\n- Daily events and competitions to win prizes\r\n- Endless truck modifications and upgrades to decide on\r\n- Trailer modifications and more\r\n- Create your truck from scratch and have it look how you want it to\r\n- Win races and gain street cred as one of the best\r\n- Complete missions given for quick cash\r\n- Collect an assortment of different brands and drive in your absolute favorite!\r\n- Drive in the classics! \r\n- Show off your best times!\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t forget to follow us! Win races and make friends along the way:\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BigRigRacingGame/ \r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/big_rig_racing_game/ \r\nReddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/Big_Rig_Racing_Game/ \r\nOfficial Website: https://www.mobirate.com/",
